@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 11, 17 and 16 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.9.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.9.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1617corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.9.0 (2026-11-19): Scope stage only. A second scope statement covers what the amendment adds: chapter 10 as a slice, the balloon and reader-note practices for chapters 10 and 11, and each file's own version. The first statement (chapters 11, 17 and 16 on the six rulings) stands."""@en .

ex:Scope10_2 a backlog:ScopeStatement ;
    rdfs:label "Chapter 10 on the rulings, and chapters 10 and 11 on the handover's practices"@en ;
    backlog:scopeForMission ex:Mission10 ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 ;
    backlog:hasIntentOrigin backlog:IOrigin_OwnerStated ; backlog:scopeCompletionState backlog:Proposed ;
    backlog:coversArea ex:Area10_Reader, ex:Area10_OwnVersion, ex:Area10_Chapter10 ;
    backlog:hasScopeDeliverable ex:Del10_Balloons, ex:Del10_ReaderNotesCheck, ex:Del10_Rework_11, ex:Del10_Spec_10, ex:Del10_Deck_10, ex:Del10_Page_10, ex:Del10_ReleaseRecord_10 ;
    backlog:hasScopeStatementText "IN: (a) Reader material: speech balloons on the existing slides of chapters 10 and 11 (one sentence per balloon, key words in bold, Trebuchet MS; concept cards grouped as one card; code slides with a story balloon beside each code box and two short result balloons under the code), with the slide count unchanged; and notes written for the reader of the handed-out slides (they explain the slide's short wording in fuller sentences, add detail the balloons do not carry, connect to related slides and chapters, give no directions to a presenter, contain no think-of statements, no prompt markers, no lambda). (b) Own versions: every changed file of chapters 10 and 11 takes one step above its own last released version (the last release is 2.44.0 of 2026-10-08, whose pages are 9.19.0); no counter is shared between files; an unreleased page is rewritten in place and no second draft of it is kept; the generator takes the released version from the published branch. (c) Chapter 10 (Reading and Writing Files): the same conversion, deck, page and release as chapter 11 (spec for the generic builder, notes, plain code, lambda-free example data, Slide code tab, full page test, three-role review). (d) Chapter 11: rework of the deck 3.0.0 and page to the practices above. EXCLUDED as in the first statement: what the chapters teach, their stories and the meaning of their examples; other chapters; the rdodi sets; exams." .
ex:Area10_Reader a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Balloons and reader notes on the chapter 10 and 11 decks"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 .
ex:Area10_OwnVersion a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Each file of chapters 10 and 11 versioned on its own"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 .
ex:Area10_Chapter10 a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Chapter 10 deck and page on the rulings"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 .
ex:Del10_Balloons a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Generic deck builder with speech balloons on existing slides"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area10_Reader .
ex:Del10_ReaderNotesCheck a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "A reader-notes check that measures presenter directions, think-of statements and missing connections"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area10_Reader .
ex:Del10_Rework_11 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Chapter 11 deck and page on balloons, reader notes and own versions"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area10_OwnVersion .
ex:Del10_Spec_10 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Spec folder of chapter 10 for the generic builder"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area10_Chapter10 .
ex:Del10_Deck_10 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Chapter 10 deck and chapter-code manifest"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area10_Chapter10 .
ex:Del10_Page_10 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Chapter 10 page with its page test result"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area10_Chapter10 .
ex:Del10_ReleaseRecord_10 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Check logs and the three-role review record of chapter 10"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area10_Chapter10 .
